{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791078360, "covers_from": "2026-10-04T01:46:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-04T01:47:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791078420, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-04T01:46:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8477, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "早上在臺北車站等公車，不止一次看到街友對著馬路小便，等公車的族群很多，也有很多觀光客，希望可以改善～", "display_name": "中正代表 No.8,477", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T01:46:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 27738, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我住政大山區的社區沒有餐廳\n住家陽台 院子都有老鼠的蹤跡\n例如：便便、尿尿\n現在鼠患真的很嚴重", "display_name": "文山代表 No.27,738", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T01:46:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 31060, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "博愛座可以撤掉嗎？太多人因為博愛座問題吵架，應該讓需要的人都可以放心的去坐，不是怕被罵不敢坐，話謝！", "display_name": "中山代表 No.31,060", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T01:46:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44521, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "司機加薪，是不是用獎金制度配合乘客打滿意度來考核獎金的級距，改善服務品質應該比較有幫助", "display_name": "中山代表 No.44,521", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 27738, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.27,738", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 31060, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.31,060", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 44521, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.44,521", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 5